  --gubbins_first_tree_builder  [2m[string]  [0mFirst-tree builder used by Gubbins in hybrid or no-starting-tree mode.[2m [default: rapidnj][0m
  --iqtree_asc_model            [2m[string]  [0mSubstitution model passed to IQ-TREE for the final per-cluster ML tree on Gubbins-filtered SNPs.[2m [default: 
